---
import BaseLayout from '../../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const locale = 'sw';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="NGO na Mashirika Yasiyo ya Faida — ERP kwa Mashirika Yanayofadhiliwa"
  description="Kraal Code kwa NGO: uhasibu wa fedha zilizozuiliwa, ufuatiliaji wa miradi, bajeti za idara, dashibodi za M&E na ripoti tayari kwa ukaguzi."
  locale={locale}
  canonicalUrl="https://kraalcode.com/sw/sekta/zisizo-faida/"
>
  <section class="page-hero section--warm"><div class="container">
    <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Njia ya mkate"><ol><li><a href="/sw/">Nyumbani</a></li><li><a href="/sw/sekta/">Sekta</a></li><li aria-current="page">NGO na Mashirika Yasiyo ya Faida</li></ol></nav>
    <h1>NGO na Mashirika Yasiyo ya Faida</h1>
    <p class="page-hero-subtext">Fuatilia fedha za wafadhili, simamia miradi, ripoti kwa wafadhili na uhifadhi hesabu tayari kwa ukaguzi — bila mfumo wa uhasibu tofauti kwa kila ruzuku.</p>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section"><div class="container container--narrow">
    <h2>Changamoto zako</h2>
    <div class="challenge-grid">
      <div class="challenge-item"><h3>Vikwazo vya wafadhili</h3><p>Wafadhili wanazuia jinsi fedha zao zinavyotumika. Kufuatilia ni fedha gani zimezuiliwa, kwa madhumuni gani na kama matumizi yanazingatia kunahitaji karatasi za hesabu za ziada.</p></div>
      <div class="challenge-item"><h3>Bajeti za miradi</h3><p>Kila mradi una bajti yake, ratiba na mahitaji ya ripoti. Kufuatilia kilichopatikana dhidi ya bajeti kwa kila mradi — juu ya wafadhili wengi — ni kazi nzito.</p></div>
      <div class="challenge-item"><h3>Ripoti kwa wafadhili</h3><p>Wafadhili tofauti wanahitaji muundo tofauti. Kutengeneza ripoti hizi kutoka kitabu kikuu kilichobuniwa kwa uhasibu wa kawaida kunachukua siku kila robo mwaka.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section section--warm"><div class="container">
    <h2>Jinsi Kraal Code inavyosaidia</h2>
    <div class="feature-grid">
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Uhasibu wa Fedha</h3><p>Fuatilia fedha zilizozuiliwa na zisizozuiliwa tofauti. Panga matumizi kwa wafadhili, miradi na mistari ya bajeti. Taarifa za fedha kwa kila mfuko.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Gharama za Miradi</h3><p>Bajeti kwa kategoria. Fuatilia kilichopatikana dhidi ya bajeti na uchambuzi wa tofauti. Panga gharama za pamoja kati ya miradi.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Bajeti za Idara</h3><p>Bajeti kwa idara, mradi au programu. Funga baada ya uidhinishaji. Fuatilia kwa wakati halisi. Tahadhari karibu na vikomo.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Taarifa za Fedha</h3><p>Sahili, taarifa ya mapato, mtiririko wa fedha na jaribio la usawa. Maoni ya idara. Toa PDF au Excel.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Njia ya Ukaguzi</h3><p>Kila muamala ni wa kudumu. Kitabu cha ukaguzi cha INSERT-pekecho kinarikodi nani alifanya nini, kutoka IP gani, wakati gani.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Ufuatiliaji na Tathmini</h3><p>Fuatilia mazoezi ya M&E, maswali, majibu na vitendo. Tengeneza ripoti za bodi na dashibodi za M&E.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section--dark section"><div class="container text-center">
    <h2>Ona Kraal Code kwa NGO</h2><p>Oma onyesho lililobinafsishwa kwa shughuli zako zinazofadhiliwa na wafadhili.</p>
    <a href="/sw/mawasiliano/" class="btn btn--inverse">Oma Onyesho →</a>
  </div></section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-hero{padding:var(--kc-space-20) 0 var(--kc-space-12)}.page-hero h1{font-size:var(--kc-text-4xl);max-width:700px}.page-hero-subtext{font-size:var(--kc-text-lg);color:var(--kc-text-secondary);max-width:60ch;margin-top:var(--kc-space-4)}.breadcrumb ol{list-style:none;padding:0;display:flex;gap:var(--kc-space-2);font-size:var(--kc-text-sm);color:var(--kc-text-tertiary);margin-bottom:var(--kc-space-6)}.breadcrumb a{color:var(--kc-teal);text-decoration:none}.breadcrumb li:not(:last-child)::after{content:'/';margin-left:var(--kc-space-2);color:var(--kc-text-tertiary)}.container--narrow{max-width:var(--kc-container-narrow)}.challenge-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:var(--kc-space-6);margin-top:var(--kc-space-6)}.challenge-item{padding:var(--kc-space-5);border-left:3px solid var(--kc-warning)}.challenge-item h3{font-size:var(--kc-text-base);font-family:var(--kc-font-body);font-weight:var(--kc-weight-semibold);margin-bottom:var(--kc-space-1)}.challenge-item p{font-size:var(--kc-text-sm);color:var(--kc-text-secondary)}.feature-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:var(--kc-space-6);margin-top:var(--kc-space-8)}.feature-card{padding:var(--kc-space-6);background:var(--kc-surface-light);border:1px solid var(--kc-border-subtle);border-radius:var(--kc-radius-lg)}.feature-card h3{font-size:var(--kc-text-lg);font-family:var(--kc-font-body);font-weight:var(--kc-weight-semibold);margin-bottom:var(--kc-space-2)}.feature-card p{font-size:var(--kc-text-sm);color:var(--kc-text-secondary)}.btn--inverse{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;padding:var(--kc-space-4) var(--kc-space-8);font-weight:var(--kc-weight-semibold);font-size:var(--kc-text-base);border-radius:var(--kc-radius-lg);background:transparent;color:var(--kc-text-inverse);border:2px solid var(--kc-teal-light);transition:all var(--kc-transition-fast);text-decoration:none;margin-top:var(--kc-space-6)}.btn--inverse:hover{background:var(--kc-teal);border-color:var(--kc-teal)}@media(max-width:768px){.page-hero h1{font-size:var(--kc-text-3xl)}.challenge-grid,.feature-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
